{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38547","headline":"禅院弈棋偶题 · 吴融","name":"禅院弈棋偶题","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"裛尘丝雨送微凉，偶出樊笼入道场。\n半偈已能消万事，一枰兼得了残阳。\n寻知世界都如梦，自喜身心甚不忙。\n更约西风摇落後，醉来终日卧禅房。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴融","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38547.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38547","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}